  "ingredients": [
    "4 ounce bacon",
    "1/4 cup sun-dried tomato pesto",
    "2 medium green bell pepper",
    "1 ounce canned chicken breast (or fresh)",
    "1/4 cup parmesan cheese",
    "1 large egg",
    "3 tablespoon coconut flour"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Start by frying the bacon in a pan. Leave it to sizzle and get nicely browned and crispy on one side.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/fresh-chicken-bacon-patties/#wprm-recipe-51021-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/04/IMG_2270.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, measure out the tomato pesto sauce.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/fresh-chicken-bacon-patties/#wprm-recipe-51021-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/04/IMG_2276.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Once the bacon is crisped up, flip it to the other side.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/fresh-chicken-bacon-patties/#wprm-recipe-51021-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/04/IMG_2280.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Chop the bell peppers in half, deseed, then add them to a food processor.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/fresh-chicken-bacon-patties/#wprm-recipe-51021-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/04/IMG_2284.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Process until finely chopped.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/fresh-chicken-bacon-patties/#wprm-recipe-51021-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/04/choppedpeppers1.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour the mixture into a bowl and pat dry with paper towels — you don't want too much extra moisture here!",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/fresh-chicken-bacon-patties/#wprm-recipe-51021-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/04/IMG_2295.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Once the bacon has finished cooking, add the canned chicken (you could also use fresh) and bacon to the food processor.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/fresh-chicken-bacon-patties/#wprm-recipe-51021-step-0-6",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/04/IMG_2301.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Process to form a chicken and bacon paste.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/fresh-chicken-bacon-patties/#wprm-recipe-51021-step-0-7",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/04/IMG_2304.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the chicken and bacon mixture to the peppers.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/fresh-chicken-bacon-patties/#wprm-recipe-51021-step-0-8",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/04/IMG_2307.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the Parmesan, tomato pesto, and egg. Mix well.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/fresh-chicken-bacon-patties/#wprm-recipe-51021-step-0-9",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/04/IMG_2310.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add coconut flour as needed — you want a nice, solid mixture that can be formed into patties.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/fresh-chicken-bacon-patties/#wprm-recipe-51021-step-0-10",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/04/IMG_2317.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Form the patties, grabbing a small scoop of the chicken mixture and pressing it between your hands.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/fresh-chicken-bacon-patties/#wprm-recipe-51021-step-0-11",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/04/IMG_2322.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fry the patties with a little oil over medium to medium-high heat until crispy, then flip and cook until crispy on opposite side.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/fresh-chicken-bacon-patties/#wprm-recipe-51021-step-0-12",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/04/IMG_2333.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Set on paper towels to cool, then serve! Optional: Serve with small sprigs of dill and chile-garlic paste.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/fresh-chicken-bacon-patties/#wprm-recipe-51021-step-0-13",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/04/chickenpatties.jpg"
    }
  ],
